cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the archived release and the associated paper."
title: "Analysis code for: Vegetation dynamics along drydowns across global climate zones"
abstract: >-
  R code used to detect drydown events from a global daily water balance,
  accumulate cumulative water deficit (CWD), extract the high and low EVI
  percentile states along drydowns, classify energy-limited and water-limited
  regimes, compute the EVI-CWD sensitivity S, and produce the figures and
  tables of the associated manuscript.
type: software
